# Burning-Eye Zubera's dies trigger reads CheckOnTriggeredCard$ X GE4, X =
# Count$TotalDamageReceivedThisTurn on the dead card (AbilityUtils.java:
# 2386-2388): Flame Slash's 4 damage kills it with 4 received, so it deals 3
# to the AI.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 3 R
queue targets 2
queue targets ai
castspell human 1
resolvestack
resolvestack
